WEBVTT

00:00:03.074 --> 00:00:03.676
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:09.429 --> 00:00:15.286
<v><b>Max:</b></v> Hey, Lucy. I’m trying to study, and you’re making too much noise.

00:00:16.116 --> 00:00:24.109
<v><b>Lucy:</b></v> It isn’t noise, it’s Beethoven. I’m practicing – I have a school concert tomorrow.

00:00:24.376 --> 00:00:26.457
You can study downstairs.

00:00:27.028 --> 00:00:30.714
<v><b>Max:</b></v> I can’t, Jake’s playing a video game.

00:00:31.202 --> 00:00:32.587
<v><b>Lucy:</b></v> What about the kitchen?

00:00:33.025 --> 00:00:39.007
<v><b>Max:</b></v> No, Dad’s cooking dinner, and he’s listening to a soccer game.

00:00:39.720 --> 00:00:42.881
It’s impossible to work in this house!

00:00:50.471 --> 00:00:51.106
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:53.839 --> 00:00:56.106
<v><b>Paul:</b></v> Isabel! Can you come here?

00:00:58.130 --> 00:00:59.213
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> What’s the matter?

00:00:59.746 --> 00:01:01.508
<v><b>Paul:</b></v> What’s happening next door?

00:01:02.027 --> 00:01:05.513
Why’s their dog barking? I can’t hear the radio.

00:01:06.196 --> 00:01:08.480
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> They’re having a party in their yard.

00:01:09.606 --> 00:01:12.123
<v><b>Paul:</b></v> Not again! Can you go and talk to them?

00:01:12.337 --> 00:01:16.817
<v><b>Isabel:</b></v> Yes, good idea. It’s their second party in three weeks!